  "interpretation": "Capture-time silvering readiness robustly predicts migration initiation and shorter initiation delay, but its gradient largely disappears for sea escapement after initiation. This supports a phase-specific control hypothesis: internal readiness structures departure, while post-departure fate is more strongly filtered by external system context.",
